     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello everybody,<div><br></div><div>I develop an app with a map created with the googleVis package. When I launch my app with RStudio on safari there is no problem I have the good legend :</div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-H2i9J4TEaxk/VSeE4Jh7bLI/AAAAAAAABZ8/gkVmFkXFlsc/s1600/Capture%2Bd%E2%80%99e%CC%81cran%2B2015-04-10%2Ba%CC%80%2B10.07.24.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-H2i9J4TEaxk/VSeE4Jh7bLI/AAAAAAAABZ8/gkVmFkXFlsc/s1600/Capture%252Bd%25E2%2580%2599e%25CC%2581cran%252B2015-04-10%252Ba%25CC%2580%252B10.07.24.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792396321012000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2p3pi-97BbkTjCimTLbENO\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-H2i9J4TEaxk/VSeE4Jh7bLI/AAAAAAAABZ8/gkVmFkXFlsc/s320/Capture%2Bd%E2%80%99e%CC%81cran%2B2015-04-10%2Ba%CC%80%2B10.07.24.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"107\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">But when I launch the application from <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792396321013000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0DTClMLJDvg3HbmFFwj3la\">shinyapps.io</a> the legend for the colorvar is black when I use safari :</p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-1o-sPIzcDCg/VSeFQj0P8wI/AAAAAAAABaE/rWSRXtqZOaY/s1600/Capture%2Bd%E2%80%99e%CC%81cran%2B2015-04-10%2Ba%CC%80%2B10.09.23.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-1o-sPIzcDCg/VSeFQj0P8wI/AAAAAAAABaE/rWSRXtqZOaY/s1600/Capture%252Bd%25E2%2580%2599e%25CC%2581cran%252B2015-04-10%252Ba%25CC%2580%252B10.09.23.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792396321013000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1cxBODG7JcGtRyC9YE5vB7\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-1o-sPIzcDCg/VSeFQj0P8wI/AAAAAAAABaE/rWSRXtqZOaY/s320/Capture%2Bd%E2%80%99e%CC%81cran%2B2015-04-10%2Ba%CC%80%2B10.09.23.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"107\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">Or doesn&#39;t appear when I use firefox :</p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-4V57KDuTkpE/VSeFjvl3HQI/AAAAAAAABaM/HWql__D0WO8/s1600/Capture%2Bd%E2%80%99e%CC%81cran%2B2015-04-10%2Ba%CC%80%2B10.10.07.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-4V57KDuTkpE/VSeFjvl3HQI/AAAAAAAABaM/HWql__D0WO8/s1600/Capture%252Bd%25E2%2580%2599e%25CC%2581cran%252B2015-04-10%252Ba%25CC%2580%252B10.10.07.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792396321013000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3_xpM_wxKZq8pa0egEzC6C\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-4V57KDuTkpE/VSeFjvl3HQI/AAAAAAAABaM/HWql__D0WO8/s320/Capture%2Bd%E2%80%99e%CC%81cran%2B2015-04-10%2Ba%CC%80%2B10.10.07.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"118\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">The same in Chrome .... :</p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Wyy5uI4bA4o/VSeFtoj4c-I/AAAAAAAABaU/Ogft4cLZwiY/s1600/Capture%2Bd%E2%80%99e%CC%81cran%2B2015-04-10%2Ba%CC%80%2B10.10.07.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Wyy5uI4bA4o/VSeFtoj4c-I/AAAAAAAABaU/Ogft4cLZwiY/s1600/Capture%252Bd%25E2%2580%2599e%25CC%2581cran%252B2015-04-10%252Ba%25CC%2580%252B10.10.07.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792396321013000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0LkW_1LrS3H8EJWY78DRq4\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Wyy5uI4bA4o/VSeFtoj4c-I/AAAAAAAABaU/Ogft4cLZwiY/s320/Capture%2Bd%E2%80%99e%CC%81cran%2B2015-04-10%2Ba%CC%80%2B10.10.07.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"118\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">Here the code to create the map :</p><div>    </div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">map &lt;- gvisGeoChart(aux, locationvar = &quot;LatLon&quot;, colorvar = input$variable, </span> hovervar = &quot;Building_Id&quot;, sizevar = input$variable2,</div><div>                      options=list(region = &#39;FR&#39;, </div><div>                                   gvis.language = &#39;fr&#39;,</div><div>                                   displayMode=&quot;markers&quot;,</div><div>                                   backgroundColor.stroke = &quot;white&quot;,</div><div>                                   colorAxis = &quot;{colors:[&#39;green&#39;,&#39;yellow&#39;,&#39;orange&#39;,&#39;red&#39;]}&quot;,</div><div>                                   width = 700, height = 500))</div></span></div></code></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">I use the function htmlOutput to display the app in ui.R :</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"></p><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div>htmlOutput(&quot;gvis.map&quot;)<br></div></code></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p>I don&#39;t understand why it works when I run the app locally and not when I run the app online with <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792396321013000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0DTClMLJDvg3HbmFFwj3la\">shinyapps.io</a> ...<p></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">Thanks in advance for your help :)</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><i>PS : here my session info</i></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><i>R version 3.1.2 (2014-10-31)</i></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><i>Platform: x86_64-apple-darwin13.4.0 (64-bit)</i></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><i>locale:</i></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><i>[1] fr_FR.UTF-8/fr_FR.UTF-8/fr_FR.UTF-8/C/fr_FR.UTF-8/fr_FR.UTF-8</i></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><i>attached base packages:</i></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><i>[1] stats     graphics  grDevices utils     datasets  methods   base     </i></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><i>other attached packages:</i></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><i>[1] reshape2_1.4.1   googleVis_0.5.8  shiny_0.11.1     shinyapps_0.3.63</i></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><i>loaded via a namespace (and not attached):<br></i></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><i> [1] bitops_1.0-6    digest_0.6.8    htmltools_0.2.6 httpuv_1.3.2    mime_0.2       </i></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><i> [6] plyr_1.8.1      R6_2.0.1        Rcpp_0.11.4     RCurl_1.95-4.5  RJSONIO_1.3-0  </i></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><i>[11] stringr_0.6.2   tools_3.1.2     xtable_1.7-4   </i></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><i><br><br></i></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><i><br><br></i></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><i><br></i></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><div><br></div></div>"
